-- Mean is a state-plus-projection machine: its fold finishes the final (left sum,count) state, exactly the last value of its scan. Count is a different machine with an explicit empty 0; empty mean has no row.
--! registry ../registries/032-avg-fold-finish.reg

--! out 600
avg/ Weight @ Cow

--! out 400 450 500 600
avg\ Weight @ Cow

--! out 0 0 0 1
(avg\ Weight @ Cow) == (avg/ Weight @ Cow)

--! out 4
#/ Cow

--! out 1 2 2 3 4 4
#\ Cow

--! out 2400
+/ Weight @ Cow

--! out
avg/ Weight @ None
